  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是否渴望超越原生生物頭盔的限制？</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">All The Heads</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 新增超過 450 種獨特的生物頭盔，覆蓋所有生物及其變體。每個頭盔都有完整的模型、精準的比例，甚至包含正確碰撞箱和音符盒音效。基於完全數據驅動系統，您可以在無需修改程式碼的情況下輕鬆添加、移除或調整任何頭盔。無論是包製作者、伺服器管理員還是收藏愛好者，這款模組都是您的完美選擇。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">所有頭盔皆可佩戴或放置，讓您裝飾、製作雕像或打造專屬紀念品。開始收藏並展示您的终极生物頭盔收藏吧！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">完整收藏：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 超過 450 個頭盔，包含所有生物變體與顏色。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">細節到位：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 精確比例、碰撞箱與音效，呈現完美效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">設計友好：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 適合建築、裝飾或對朋友惡作劇。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏆 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">盡情展示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以時尚方式在世界的任何位置展示您的收藏。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">完全數據驅動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 添加或編輯頭盔定義時無需觸碰程式碼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔌 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">兼容模組：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 透過 datapacks 輕鬆支援其他模組成新生物。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與服務器均需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric &amp; NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若支援模組，可直接從遊戲內使用模組選單進行配置（需在 Fabric 上安裝由</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (由</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">提供)）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，安裝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">也是必需的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本編輯手動配置，所有文件均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，取決於配置類型。某些模組可能不包含所有類型，或者根本不存在。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝</span><a href=\"https://vanillatweaks.net/\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Vanilla Tweaks Team</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">的</span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">More Mob Heads</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">數據包，其啟發了本模組中使用的多種默認掉落率。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/metal-bundles\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dyed-flames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/dyedflames/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
